       fhir:definition [ fhir:v "Identifies who is responsible for the information in this section, not necessarily who typed it in.   \n\nThe actual author of the section when it is not the author of the composition. If author is not specified, the author is assumed to be the author of the parent section or the author of the composition." ] ;
       fhir:requirements [ fhir:v "Identifies who is responsible for the content." ] ;
